  "title": "钓鱼",
  "html": "<p class=\"ws-p\">因为打过了相信线，投入了高额的588两黄金，在姜卫那里获得5两白银的蓝色鱼饵和3两的绿色鱼饵的购买权限，想着蓝色鱼饵是否能够为我的钓鱼收益带来提升，所以做了一个简短的测试。</p><p class=\"ws-p\">测试鱼竿：</p><figure class=\"ws-figure\"><img src=\"assets/JGwIb4Zy5ouyaxxdUVNc6AqEnlg.png\" alt=\"攻略配图\" width=\"213\" height=\"115\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p class=\"ws-p\">鱼饵数量：<span style=\"color:rgb(36,91,219)\">蓝</span><span style=\"color:rgb(46,161,33)\">绿</span>白鱼饵各1000个</p><p class=\"ws-p\">测试结果</p><figure class=\"ws-figure\"><img src=\"assets/OJRFbuqWioOdFxxS450ccr2Vnvf.png\" alt=\"攻略配图\" width=\"536\" height=\"177\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p class=\"ws-p\">完整数量与收益汇总：</p><figure class=\"ws-figure\"><img src=\"assets/Cl4Gb7AGEoJbY2xtnrbcdYrUnBh.png\" alt=\"攻略配图\" width=\"541\" height=\"205\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p class=\"ws-p\">收益：147.55两黄金</p><p class=\"ws-p\">成本：50两黄金</p><p class=\"ws-p\">完整数量与收益汇总：</p><figure class=\"ws-figure\"><img src=\"assets/VhRvbpPN7oMC0Xx4XeYcAgXSnvc.png\" alt=\"攻略配图\" width=\"533\" height=\"260\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p class=\"ws-p\">收益：139.1两黄金</p><p class=\"ws-p\">成本：30两黄金</p><figure class=\"ws-figure\"><img src=\"assets/LAcobti6to6ZX1x7DoEcSJE3n0b.png\" alt=\"攻略配图\" width=\"537\" height=\"247\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p class=\"ws-p\">收益：121.2两黄金</p><p class=\"ws-p\">成本：10两黄金</p><p class=\"ws-p\">满精炼<span style=\"color:rgb(220,155,4)\">★★★★★★黄鱼竿</span>+<span style=\"color:rgb(36,91,219)\">蓝饵</span>能出<span style=\"color:rgb(222,120,2)\">橙鱼</span></p><p class=\"ws-source\">内容整理自飞书《武神MUD2手册》· <a href=\"https://ucn595zz2fou.feishu.cn/wiki/RKdrwtR9ZipftZkZPhoc6ZZNn1e\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">查看原文</a></p>",
